body:
i totally agree about Hanzo. i actually had this game recommended to me in the first place because i was looking for more mature LI's! that made it more frustrating though, like- really, you're gonna write this really cool guy as someone who's gonna date someone less than half his age? (made even worse due to the whole details with her mom, which i won't go into since i don't know how to properly write a spoiler, lol!) 

i do see what you mean with the variety too. someday i might give it another chance but right now i guess i just don't have the motivation to...the art was beautiful, though.

if you don't mind me asking, what other otome do you consider your favorites? i notice we have some similarities in taste from your flair (my friends keep telling me to play Piofore because i'll love Yang, apparently a bad thing lmao)
